    "# The Butterfly Effect of War - Global Impact Analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "When a war starts in one country, the shockwaves don't stop at its borders.\n",
    "This notebook studies how conflict causes ripple effects across the world —\n",
    "rising food prices, refugee crises, energy shocks, and political instability\n",
    "in countries that never fired a single shot.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Three real examples:**\n",
    "- 🇺🇦 Ukraine 2022 → wheat shortage → hunger in Egypt & Lebanon\n",
    "- 🇸🇾 Syria 2011 → 1.5M refugees → Lebanon's economy collapsed\n",
    "- 🇵🇸 Gaza 2023 → Red Sea attacks → global shipping delays\n",
    "\n",
    "**What this notebook does:**\n",
    "- Uses Gemma 3 (Google's AI model) to analyze war's global chain reactions\n",
    "- Connects conflict events to economic, social, and political data worldwide\n",
    "- Makes the invisible ripples visible — with real numbers and clear explanations"
   ]
