    "## Why Gemma 3 (4B Instruction-Tuned)?\n",
    "\n",
    "**Model:** `gemma-3-4b-it`\n",
    "**Framework:** Transformers (Hugging Face) + PyTorch\n",
    "\n",
    "**Why this model:**\n",
    "- `4b` = 4 billion parameters — smart enough for deep analysis,\n",
    "   small enough to run on Kaggle's free GPU without crashing\n",
    "- `it` = instruction-tuned — I can ask it plain English questions\n",
    "   like *\"what economic effects did this war cause?\"* and it answers clearly\n",
    "- Transformers library loads it in 5 lines of code — beginner-friendly\n",
    "   but research-grade powerful\n",
    "\n",
    "**In simple terms:** It's the right balance of brain size and speed\n",
    "for a research notebook running on free cloud hardware."
